(library
 (name ix_raspberry)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules Intc Systimer Pl011 Miniuart Framebuffer Display Devices Usb Usernet Dwc2 Sdhost Dma Board Gic Pi4 Prof Status)
 (libraries ix_machine ix_machine_compat unix))

; the host's window, mini-qemu's and tiny-machine's (tiny/TinyMachineWindow.ml)
